==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|по-|срать}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|посра́ть}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|посра́ть|pf|impf=срать}}

# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} to [[have]] a [[shit]], to [[take a shit]] {{qualifier|referring to the whole act, usually in an organised and intentional manner}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[неа|Неа]], [[вообще́-то]] [[я]] [[собира́лся]] [[пойти́]] '''посра́ть'''.|Nah, actually I'm gonna go '''take a shit'''.}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar|figuratively|impersonal|usually in the infinitive even when translated with a finite verb}} for (someone) to not [[give a shit]] {{+obj|ru|dat<someone> + :на(acc)<about someone/something>}} {{q|idiomatically translated by {{m+|en|[[not]] [[give a shit]]}} with the dative object as the subject}}
#: {{syn|ru|всё равно|насра́ть|плева́ть|по́фиг|по́ хую}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[мне|Мне]] '''посра́ть''' [[на]] [[сосе́дей]].|I '''don't give a shit''' about the neighbours.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf-intr|6°b/c|посра́ть|or|6°c/c|посра́ть|посе́р}}
